  "description": "Most people think Na Yu Bin is the perfect woman who have everything she needs: she's pretty, kind, and competent. But behind these perfectness, there is one thing that people don't know about her. She's the Cup A that people bullied during her time in the college. One day, she met a witch who fulfilled her wish to have a Cup D. In exchange for her wish, she has to find her true love--or she'll be back to her previous Cup A. Could she complete her mission to find her true love?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=840316), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12591375)",
